  "independentFinding": "The incident-specific report identifies Bactrocera dorsalis (Hendel) group, not the catalog species Bactrocera dorsalis. Exact Long Beach, Los Angeles County geography and the trapping interval are supported; exact species admission remains held.",
  "limitations": [
    "Page 3 states that group members are difficult to distinguish based on individual specimens. Page 11 distinguishes sibling species and page 12 states uncertainty as to which species has invaded.",
    "An unqualified generic pest-profile heading on page 14 does not resolve the actual incident identification.",
    "August 18, 2026 is amendment date; March 28, 2027 is projected program endpoint. Neither substitutes for occurrence timing or proves eradication.",
